{"bills": {"hb/1": {"abstracts": [{"abstract": "Minimum wage. Increases the minimum wage incrementally to $15.00 per hour by January 1, 2028. The bill codifies the adjusted state hourly minimum wage of $12.77 per hour that is effective January 1, 2026, and increases the minimum wage to $13.75 per hour effective January 1, 2027, and to $15.00 per hour effective January 1, 2028. Effective January 1, 2029, and annually thereafter, the bill requires the minimum wage to be adjusted to reflect increases in the consumer price index. This bill is identical to SB 1.", "note": "SUMMARY AS PASSED"}, {"abstract": "An Act to amend and reenact \u00a7 40.1-28.10 of the Code of Virginia, relating to minimum wage.", "note": "title"}], "actions": [{"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["filing", "introduction"], "date": "2025-11-17", "description": "Prefiled and ordered printed; Offered 01-14-2026 26101997D", "order": 0}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "date": "2025-11-17", "description": "Referred to Committee on Labor and Commerce", "order": 1}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": [], "date": "2026-01-20", "description": "Fiscal Impact Statement from Department of Planning and Budget (HB1)", "order": 2}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["committee-passage"], "date": "2026-01-20", "description": "Reported from Labor and Commerce and referred to Appropriations (15-Y 7-N)", "order": 3}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": [], "date": "2026-01-23", "description": "Fiscal Impact Statement from Department of Planning and Budget (HB1)", "order": 4}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["committee-passage"], "date": "2026-01-28", "description": "Reported from Appropriations (15-Y 7-N)", "order": 5}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["reading-1"], "date": "2026-01-30", "description": "Read first time", "order": 6}, {"chamber": "lower", "classification": ["reading-2"], "date": "2026-02-02", "description": "Read second time and engrossed"